  "sourceTitle": "Banana, Oatmeal, Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Banana, Oatmeal, Chocolate Chip Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 23, 2009 - 12:22am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 cups flour\n1 teaspoon baking powder\n1/4 teaspoon nutmeg\n1/4 teaspoon baking soda\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 cup sugar\n2/3 cup Crisco\n2 eggs\n1 cup mashed bananas\n1 1/2 cups dry quick oats\n1 (6 oz.) pkg. chocolate chips\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Beat sugar, eggs, Crisco. Add banana, chocolate chips. Then the flour mixture and oatmeal. Mix well. Drop by spoon on greased cookie sheet. Bake at 375 degrees for 12-13 minutes.",
